Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.29,0:00:26.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,1320)}narrator: That reply is invented.\NThe official synopsis says Ram\Nhelps on Roswaal's instructions. It\Ndoes not settle her private\Nfeelings.
